    {
      "subId": "2103404",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Lan",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210340501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210340501": {
            "id": "210340501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Traveler, have you already wiped out the monsters in that camp?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340504"
            ]
          },
          "210340504": {
            "id": "210340504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Just some ordinary monsters. It didn't take too much out of me. I also got lucky and found a valuable piece from a longsword.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340505"
            ]
          },
          "210340505": {
            "id": "210340505",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I haven't found anything on my side...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340506"
            ]
          },
          "210340506": {
            "id": "210340506",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Don't worry about it. You helped me rule out a misidentified location, so thanks.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340507"
            ]
          },
          "210340507": {
            "id": "210340507",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Here, you've earned this."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2103405",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Lan",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210340601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210340601": {
            "id": "210340601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Traveler, have you already wiped out the monsters in that camp?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340604"
            ]
          },
          "210340604": {
            "id": "210340604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Just some ordinary monsters. It didn't take too much out of me. Shame that I didn't find anything of value. It's just scrap here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340605"
            ]
          },
          "210340605": {
            "id": "210340605",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "How'd it go on your end? Did you find anything?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340606"
            ]
          },
          "210340606": {
            "id": "210340606",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I found this.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340607"
            ]
          },
          "210340607": {
            "id": "210340607",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Huh... That looks like a piece of a sword... Thanks. I'll bring it back with me and examine it more closely.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340608"
            ]
          },
          "210340608": {
            "id": "210340608",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Thanks, Traveler. Here's your payment. Please accept it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2103401",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210340101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210340101": {
            "id": "210340101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Hmph, looks like it should be here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340104"
            ]
          },
          "210340104": {
            "id": "210340104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Traveler. I didn't expect to see you here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340105"
            ]
          },
          "210340105": {
            "id": "210340105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Do you remember the sword hilt you found last time? Well, it turns out that it was indeed part of the Unseen Razor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340106"
            ]
          },
          "210340106": {
            "id": "210340106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "The funny thing is, the only reason I could recognize it is because I secretly etched a marking onto it as a child...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340107"
            ]
          },
          "210340107": {
            "id": "210340107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "I remember I told my brother that if he ever decided to wield another sword, he had to give the Unseen Razor to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340108"
            ]
          },
          "210340108": {
            "id": "210340108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Heh. I suppose neither one of us could have foreseen how things turned out... I can't believe this is how I ended up finding the Unseen Razor. Looks like the sword... really did get shattered.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340109"
            ]
          },
          "210340109": {
            "id": "210340109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Alright. I suppose I'll cut to the chase now that you're here, Traveler. I'm going to need your help again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340110"
            ]
          },
          "210340110": {
            "id": "210340110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Two gatherings of monsters should be loitering somewhere ahead. They seem to have amassed a sizable inventory of damaged weapons to hoard within their camps, though I'm uncertain as to why.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340111"
            ]
          },
          "210340111": {
            "id": "210340111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "The Adventurers' Guild is worried that these monsters will wreak havoc on the surroundings and originally wanted to draft a commission to resolve this. However, after I reviewed the details, I thought that perhaps... I could find some pieces of the Unseen Razor here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340112"
            ]
          },
          "210340112": {
            "id": "210340112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Traveler, let's each clear out a camp.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340113"
            ]
          },
          "210340113": {
            "id": "210340113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "The camp to the left is being held by a group of hilichurls. Alone, each of them should present no danger to you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340114"
            ]
          },
          "210340114": {
            "id": "210340114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "But their numbers are substantial. Should you face them directly and all at once, it might require some effort to prevail, even for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340115"
            ]
          },
          "210340115": {
            "id": "210340115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "On the right is a Stonehide Lawachurl. As for how dangerous facing one is... I don't think I really need to elaborate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340116"
            ]
          },
          "210340116": {
            "id": "210340116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Since I'm the one who asked for your aid, I'll let you select which camp to clear."
          }
        }
      }
    },
