            "text": "Thanks, Traveler. Here's your payment. Please accept it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340710"
            ]
          },
          "210340710": {
            "id": "210340710",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "My desire is a simple one... I just want to reforge the Unseen Razor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340711"
            ]
          },
          "210340711": {
            "id": "210340711",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Though the blueprints detailing how the Unseen Razor was made and what materials were used have been lost... I'll find a way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210340712"
            ]
          },
          "210340712": {
            "id": "210340712",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "If I can reforge the Unseen Razor, then my brother will also... *sigh*"
          },
          "210340702": {
            "id": "210340702",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How's it going on your end?"
          }
        }
      }
